title: StartDay4
position: -125,-487
---
<<set $daysPassed = 741>>
<<play_sound AlarmClock>>
<<set $negSelfPerception += 1>>
I wake up. The alarm sounds the same, but something doesn't.
Day {$daysPassed}.
The cryopod's readout shows nominal stats. My body disagrees.
The memory of how things ended with {$catName} is the first thing that surfaces, before my name, before the mission, before anything useful.
<<show_ui ClickToInteract>>
<<show MonitorOffDay4>>
===

title: OnClickedMonitorDay4
position: -128,-338
---
<<hide_all_ui_objects>>
<<show MonitorOn>>
I power on the monitor.
The comms buffer is empty. No packets. No pings. No "STILL HERE."
Just silence, and the report I never submitted last cycle.
    -> (start the day)
===
